The Shapes are a group of enemies encountered in [[Act 3]].

== Exploder ==
{{Enemy Infobox|Exploder}}
{{Keyword Infobox|Explosive}}
Exploders explode. Profound knowledge.

=== Pattern ===
{{Intents|Exploder}}
Always uses this pattern:
* {{Int|Exploder|Attack}}
* {{Int|Exploder|Attack}}
* {{Int|Exploder|Explode}}

{{Clear}}
== Repulsor ==
{{Enemy Infobox|Repulsor}}
{{Small Card Infobox|Dazed}}
Repulsor repeatedly gives the player {{C|Dazed}}.

=== Pattern ===
{{Intents|Repulsor}}
'''On all turns:'''
* {{Int|Repulsor|Attack}} 20% chance
* {{Int|Repulsor|Daze}} 80% chance

Cannot use {{Int|Repulsor|Attack}} twice in a row.

{{Clear}}

== Spiker ==
{{Enemy Infobox|Spiker}}
{{Keyword Infobox|Thorns}}
Spikers focus on building up {{KW|Thorns}} to make them more dangerous to kill as the battle progresses.

=== Pattern ===
{{Intents|Spiker}}
On every turn, it has a 50/50 chance of using either {{Int|Spiker|Attack}} or {{Int|Spiker|Buff Thorns}}.

Cannot use {{Int|Spiker|Attack}} twice in a row. Cannot use {{Int|Spiker|Buff Thorns}} once it has been used 6 times and will instead using {{Int|Spiker|Attack}}.

{{Clear}}
