=== Act 3 ===
In the Easy Pool's '''3 Shapes''' encounter with:
* Three random Shapes (No more than two of the same shape)

In the Hard Pool's '''4 Shapes''' encounter with:
* Four random Shapes (No more than two of the same shape)

In the '''Spheric Guardian''' encounter with:
* {{M|Spheric Guardian}}
* Two random Shapes

